# the run time goes by its own table, which locks Math.imul, and by the list of the image. The wire lists nothing: the image lists the member because Link has followed a write to it, so the store goes through
# put(Math, () => 7); print(Math.imul(2, 2))   with   put = (o, v) => { o.imul = v }
# with the list left empty the store throws a TypeError, and nothing is printed
